    "inserted_text": "**Instruction:** app callsites use `language.t(...)` for ordinary copy and `language.plural(...)` for counts; native main-process callsites consume shared typed translation bundles through `nativeT(...)`. Shared language/UI modules own locale selection, plural resolution, fallback and interpolation. Feature/native callsites must not branch on locale, choose plural categories or concatenate grammatical fragments. Preserve existing English keys and text byte-for-byte; extend the shared bundle/API for richer grammar. The documented startup exception remains. (`packages/app-shell/AGENTS.md:23–28`; `apps/desktop/AGENTS.md:5–9`.)\n\n",
    "inserted_utf8_bytes": 637,
